        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "6f30282b-ce8e-5da6-a3e6-e96ada61b9c5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Lykan HyperSport\n- Companies: W Motors\n- Places: Lebanon, United Arab Emirates, Arab World\n- People: F. Gary Gray, Chris Morgan\n- Works: The Fate of the Furious, Fast & Furious 8, Fast 8, F8\n\nFacts:\n- In 2012, W Motors was founded in Lebanon as a United Arab Emirates-based company.\n- The Lykan HyperSport is a Lebanese limited-production supercar built by W Motors with collaboration from Lebanese, French, and Italian engineers.\n- The Lykan HyperSport was the first car designed and produced indigenously in the Arab World.\n- In 2017, The Fate of the Furious, also known as Fast & Furious 8, Fast 8, and F8, was released as an American action film.\n- F. Gary Gray directed The Fate of the Furious.\n- Chris Morgan wrote The Fate of the Furious.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
